 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 1.2,
   "end": 8.728375,
   "text": "This is TEMT, the Transportation Emission Measurement Tool from IIM Bangalore's Supply Chain Management Centre."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.068375,
   "end": 10.984832999999998,
   "text": "Here is the whole product, end to end."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.535493037994385,
   "end": 20.918618037994385,
   "text": "The website opens with a live walkthrough of what TEMT does: enter a shipment, get its footprint, compare cleaner modes, and report it."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.258618037994385,
   "end": 25.885868037994385,
   "text": "Below are the credentials, every module, and a lane comparison anyone can try."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.38749303608704,
   "end": 36.72899303608703,
   "text": "Open the app, and start with your company, the guided tour, or a sample workspace."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.068993036087036,
   "end": 41.270368036087035,
   "text": "Let's load the FMCG sample, labelled as sample data everywhere."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.970493219192505,
   "end": 48.544743219192505,
   "text": "The overview shows the year's well-to-wheel emissions, intensity per tonne-kilometre, and progress against your target."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.88474321919251,
   "end": 59.15907621919251,
   "text": "Each month splits into tank-to-wheel and well-to-tank, as ISO 14083 requires, followed by modes, business units, lanes and reduction opportunities."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.8604930856781,
   "end": 68.2483260856781,
   "text": "The quick calculator compares every practical mode, door to door. Pune to Kolkata by rail is about eighty-four percent lower than by truck."
  },
  {
   "start": 69.67949309140015,
   "end": 74.52995109140015,
   "text": "The full calculator covers road, courier, rail, air, sea and inland waterways."
  },
  {
   "start": 74.86995109140014,
   "end": 83.47095109140015,
   "text": "Enter a city or a PIN code, and TEMT estimates the shortest feasible distance. Pick the truck class, and the result updates live."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.81095109140014,
   "end": 91.06482609140015,
   "text": "The calculation basis shows what an auditor needs: activity, distance type, intensity, factor source and data quality."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.40482609140014,
   "end": 94.63924309140015,
   "text": "With fuel receipts, switch to fuel-based for primary data."
  },
  {
   "start": 97.57349314480591,
   "end": 104.00924314480591,
   "text": "Rail, air and sea work the same way. Rail uses the Indian average for mixed diesel and electric traction."
  },
  {
   "start": 104.34924314480591,
   "end": 113.0196181448059,
   "text": "Air uses great-circle distances between airports, and sea legs are routed port to port through a sea-lane network, by trade lane or vessel type."
  },
  {
   "start": 118.82349314480591,
   "end": 127.26057614480591,
   "text": "Compare modes ranks road, rail, air and coastal options for the same cargo, flags impractical ones, and saves your choice to the ledger."
  },
  {
   "start": 128.98449315815736,
   "end": 141.99020115815736,
   "text": "Real freight is often multimodal. The chain builder links legs and hubs in one shipment: here, a factory to the gateway port by trailer, then a container ship, with terminal handling counted as a hub operation."
  },
  {
   "start": 144.08649315625001,
   "end": 155.04161815625002,
   "text": "Bulk import reads the TEMT template, six formats from earlier TEMT versions and GST e-way bills, and checks every row before anything is saved."
  },
  {
   "start": 155.74349322109987,
   "end": 162.20828522109986,
   "text": "Every shipment lands in the ledger. Search, filter, and open any one to see its legs and calculation basis."
  },
  {
   "start": 164.2024930933075,
   "end": 169.8476600933075,
   "text": "Accounts are optional. Sign in on its own page, and your workspace syncs securely across devices."
  },
  {
   "start": 170.1876600933075,
   "end": 175.0236180933075,
   "text": "The server recalculates it independently, and your sessions and report history live here."
  },
  {
   "start": 180.9744931676941,
   "end": 186.0987431676941,
   "text": "Reports are read in the tool first, down to the SEBI BRSR Principle 6 mapping."
  },
  {
   "start": 186.4387431676941,
   "end": 192.60766016769412,
   "text": "Then export them in six formats: PDF, Excel, Word, CSV, JSON and Power BI."
  },
  {
   "start": 196.97349300175478,
   "end": 202.2875760017548,
   "text": "A board-ready PDF, with charts, the BRSR table, methodology and factors."
  },
  {
   "start": 203.0904931047516,
   "end": 206.3169511047516,
   "text": "An Excel workbook with a sheet for every view, down to each leg."
  },
  {
   "start": 208.72049321919252,
   "end": 210.10836821919253,
   "text": "An editable Word report."
  },
  {
   "start": 211.39049305706789,
   "end": 214.42407605706788,
   "text": "A Power BI pack with a star schema and DAX measures."
  },
  {
   "start": 215.12449302464296,
   "end": 217.80624302464295,
   "text": "Plus CSV and JSON for any other system."
  },
  {
   "start": 218.50649299412538,
   "end": 227.38561799412537,
   "text": "The reduction planner tests rail shift, air to road, consolidation, electric trucks and load factors, and measures each lever against your target."
  },
  {
   "start": 228.08649315625001,
   "end": 239.49920115625002,
   "text": "The factor library lists every value TEMT applies, with its source: TEMT's own India-specific factors first, and the GLEC defaults alongside for comparison."
  },
  {
   "start": 239.83920115625003,
   "end": 245.47932615625,
   "text": "Settings hold your NIFTY 500 company, targets, backups, and an optional local AI model."
  },
  {
   "start": 246.1804930189209,
   "end": 247.8873680189209,
   "text": "The Copilot runs in your browser."
  },
  {
   "start": 248.2273680189209,
   "end": 251.3997850189209,
   "text": "Twenty tonnes from Mumbai to Delhi by thirty-two foot truck."
  },
  {
   "start": 251.7397850189209,
   "end": 252.8500770189209,
   "text": "Compare that with rail."
  },
  {
   "start": 253.1900770189209,
   "end": 260.9288270189209,
   "text": "Summarise FY 2025\u201326. It calculates, compares, analyses and exports, on request."
  },
  {
   "start": 261.62849321156307,
   "end": 264.59911821156305,
   "text": "And a fourteen-step guided tour explains every screen."
  },
  {
   "start": 267.0417020776825,
   "end": 275.1034100776825,
   "text": "TEMT: India-specific factors, ISO 14083 certification, and reports that stand up to scrutiny."
  },
  {
   "start": 275.4434100776825,
   "end": 276.8528680776825,
   "text": "Measure your next shipment today."
  }
 ],
